why: The 36 are the entries of the function-name table: 17 functions the file declares, 15 'CTOR:' initializer recipes of globals, 3 auto-declared callees (Itoa, Println, Sqrt) and 1 closure. Of the three helpers in debugging.go, [ORG]_ASSERT_ (5-10) and DEBUGBREAK_ (16-18) only log; [ORG]_Unhandled (12-14) panics.
